quieter October than September.

250
00:12:39,294 --> 00:12:42,684
But the Model Y is the reason
electric cars stopped being a niche in

251
00:12:42,734 --> 00:12:43,624
Australia.

252
00:12:43,674 --> 00:12:46,424
When an EV sits on the
national podium for the year,

253
00:12:46,474 --> 00:12:48,164
